			description: [
				"Remember cells? That's the same deal."
				"To request a craft you have to get one of those."
				""
				"The logic is simple - ~1 byte per item, counting all inputs/outputs/intermediates."
				""
				"The shape of the cpu must be a cuboid (rectangle, cube, etc.), maximum size is 16x16x16 with no air gaps. You can use crafting units in the structure."
