				""
				"Keep in mind that this encodes item-only pattern, meaning you can't do anything with liquids or gases."
				""
				"\"allow substitutions\" allow ingredients to be interchanged. For example, if recipe uses 2 copper ingots, by default it will use only the type of ingots you put in when encoding. If you allow substitutions, it will use any copper ingots."
